# Re-freeze archives (Ada). Commit logs, step status, junit, manifests, JSON/CSV
# results and notes. Do NOT commit build products or copies of model sources:
# the reproduce-* work trees contain transformed copies of the 20 imported
# sweep models and bundled third-party UMATs whose provenance or licence is
# unresolved (reviews/scout-model-provenance.md). Their hashes are kept in
# each SHA256SUMS file; the files stay local.
*/reproduce-*/work/
*/reproduce-*/**/*.f
*/reproduce-*/**/*.for
*/reproduce-*/**/*.f90
*/reproduce-*/**/*.inc
*/reproduce-*/**/*.INC
*/r1/verify/**/build_*/
*/r1/verify/newton_k*/oti/
*/r1/verify/newton_k*/build_oti/
*/r1/check/**/build*/
*/r1/check/**/collaborator/
*/r1/check/**/abi_check/
*.o
*.obj
*.mod
*.exe
*.so
*.dll
*.a
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
# Round work trees hold transformed copies of the sweep models and of
# j2_props.f / ICP sources; results keep only tables and JSON.
*/rounds/*/work/
*/rounds/**/*.f
*/rounds/**/*.for
*/rounds/**/*.f90
*/rounds/**/*.dat
*/rounds/**/*.INC
*/rounds/**/*.inc
*/rounds/**/*.sh
# Generated OTI modules (from the vendored GPL OTIlib templates).
*/r1/**/otim*.f90
*/r1/**/master_parameters.f90
*/r1/**/real_utils.f90
*/r1/**/oti_intrinsics.f90
*/r1/**/library_twins/
# Run logs are evidence here; override the workspace-level *.log rule (LaTeX).
!*.log
